53,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, agreed. The data is clear. We need a plan that fits the seven-person reality, not an idealized vision. Let us see the candidates.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
